Cell["\<\
The yearly standard deviation (upper graph) broadly decreases with the yearly \
average (lower graph) for electricity demand.
The standard deviation series is not stationary meaning the seasonal \
variations are not constant. 
The preferred decomposition model is then multiplicative.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.930631220702341*^9, 3.9306312363543053`*^9}, {
  3.9306313410193214`*^9, 3.930631367505999*^9}, {3.930631411310593*^9, 
  3.930631425787424*^9}, {3.9321884965298834`*^9, 3.932188497930271*^9}, {
  3.946100574124895*^9, 3.946100615224001*^9}, {3.946101498207424*^9, 
  3.9461015008923244`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9034e2a3-80f7-f543-82bd-\
761167fdf28e"]
}, Closed]],

