Cell["\<\
Optimised model has 6 Fourier components and a time lag of 1 month compared \
to the observed data.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.930644977315668*^9, 3.930644986813907*^9}, {
   3.930645118553623*^9, 3.930645130055937*^9}, {3.930885589969492*^9, 
