Cell["\<\
We still have a cyclical components, e.g. a repetition every 14 lags.
Let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s see if we can model these separately.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.930709903812231*^9, 3.9307101142533913`*^9}, {
   3.930738046499569*^9, 3.930738087071373*^9}, {3.9308860619583225`*^9, 
   3.9308860806063576`*^9}, {3.9313435561785336`*^9, 3.931343567861709*^9}, 
   3.9327188499406166`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"5dde937d-01d0-e241-8c7f-\
caca1c407f26"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["4.2 Identify and analyse cyclical components", "Subsection",
