ac58302436c1"],

Cell["\<\
With the same low pass filter we can isolate the trend (period >1year) and \
decompose the time series with the cyclical components.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.930711849185271*^9, 3.9307119142279453`*^9}, {
  3.930734129872977*^9, 3.930734227290089*^9}, {3.9307382821705112`*^9, 
