Cell["\<\
Predictions from the multiplicative decomposition model -  monthly \
resolution. With an excellent fit over the training and validation periods, \
the model also shows good accuracy over the testing period from 2019 to 2021 \
with an overall error of 3.25%. (All error values are MAPE.).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.946116600827364*^9, 
  3.9461166311847763`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"96610502-5bf4-2b4a-96ca-\
093f113a9439"],

